    "text": "Marnie's Morpeko & Grimmsnarl ex Challenge Deck, released on 7 March 2025: a ready-built 60-card deck with damage counters and markers, a coin, a paper playmat showing the trainer and a player guide. The official page notes that its contents differ from the Japanese starter set of the same name. It is built around Marnie's Grimmsnarl ex, with a full-art Marnie's Morpeko and the Spikemuth Gym Stadium."
